BSIM3 gate admittance in accumulation, depletion and inversion
* Provenance: original Sansho circuit and parameter choices from the BSIM3v3.3 parameter list.
.model nch nmos level=8 version=3.3
+ tox=8n xj=0.13u nch=2.1e17 vth0=0.54 k1=0.52 k2=-0.023
+ u0=460 vsat=92000 rdsw=85 pclm=1.15
+ lint=9n wint=15n cgso=170p cgdo=150p cf=65p capmod=2 noff=1.12 voffcv=-0.03 acde=0.85 moin=12 cgsl=50p cgdl=30p
Vd d 0 0.55
Va ga 0 dc -1.3 ac 1
Vb gb 0 dc -0.1 ac 1
Vi gi 0 dc 1.35 ac 1
Ma d ga 0 0 nch w=5u l=0.6u
Mb d gb 0 0 nch w=5u l=0.6u
Mi d gi 0 0 nch w=5u l=0.6u
.ac dec 4 1meg 1g
.save i(Va) i(Vb) i(Vi)
.end
